post.description:
Before sending an approved notice on WhatsApp: recipients, guardians left out by reason,
languages and the estimated Meta cost incl. GST, paid by the school to Meta (US-2204 AC1;
``message.send``). Returns a preview token valid 30 minutes; nothing is sent. Errors: 404;
409 ``notice_not_approved``; 422 ``section_ids`` (``not_found``, ``not_current_year``,
``too_many``).

get.description:
A presigned GET (at most 5 minutes, attachment) for the certificate of deletion (English;
Telugu too only while Telugu is shown, ADR-0036). ``409 certificate_pending`` until it is
issued. Audited as ``tenant.deletion_certificate_downloaded``.

The parents' and staff notice templates: version, placeholders the school has not filled,
and whether a newer version exists than the last one issued (FR-DPDP-002, FR-DPDP-003;
permission ``privacy.read``).

The parent page for the cookie's link (the BFF sends the cookie's token in
``X-SOS-Public-Token``): kind, expiry, language (guardian, else school, else English;
FR-PUB-008), the school's name and the content of its kind (ADR-0046 decision 2;
FR-PUB-009). Counts a view (FR-PUB-012).

delete.description:
Unlink a guardian from the student (permission ``student.update_nonidentity``;
``If-Match`` with the guardian's ETag). A guardian no other student is linked to is deleted
with their phone and address.
